TITLE Albite kinetics pH2 200C with Fe2/Fe3 and H2S(g)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    Fe(3) 4e-3
    Fe(2) 4e-3
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 1000 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step Si_species_count
10 PUNCH SIM_NO, SYS("Si")
END
